      "body": "I built a client-side tool that detects and removes 30+ types of invisible Unicode characters (zero-width spaces, joiners, em dashes) that AI systems like ChatGPT (Gemini, Claude) may use for watermarking text.\n\n• 100% client-side - your text never leaves your browser\n• Detects zero-width spaces (U+200B), joiners (U+200D), and other invisible markers\n• Real-time detection with character visualization\n• No registration, no tracking, completely free\n• Multi-language support (EN/DE/ES)\n\ntry it out:\nhttps://removegptwatermark.com/",
